WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
A model never sees letters. Before it reads anything, your text is chopped into pieces.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Common words get one piece. Rare words get split into chunks the model has seen before.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:03:12.000
You pay per token, and the context window is counted in tokens, so it pays to know them.
